       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RSA.


       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TPWD PIC 9(10).
       01 TN PIC 9(10).
       01 TE PIC 9(10).

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 ACTION PIC A(3).
       01 RSA_N PIC 9(10).
       01 RSA_EXPONENT PIC 9(10).
       01 VAL PIC 9(10).
       01 RSA_RESULT PIC 9(10).


       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING VAL, RSA_RESULT.
       10Start.
           MOVE FUNCTION MOD(VAL, 100) TO TPWD.
           COMPUTE RSA_RESULT = FUNCTION MOD(TPWD ** 5, 13333337).
